* {{cite news|url=https://www.washingtonpost.com/es/post-opinion/2022/01/12/nayib-bukele-el-salvador-oposicion-autoritarismo-periodistas-fmln-twitter/|title=Opinión: El Autoritarismo se Afianzó en El Salvador y la Oposición Sigue Sin Comprender el Bukelismo|trans-title=Opinion: Authoritarianism is Entrenched in El Salvador and the Opposition Continues to Not Comprehend Bukelism|language=es|date=12 January 2022|access-date=12 January 2023|newspaper=[[The Washington Post]]|first1=Ricardo|last1=Valencia|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220112165156/https://www.washingtonpost.com/es/post-opinion/2022/01/12/nayib-bukele-el-salvador-oposicion-autoritarismo-periodistas-fmln-twitter/|archive-date=12 January 2022|url-status=live}}</ref> resulting in what many journalists described as [[democratic backsliding]].<ref>Multiple sources:
